stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> OTP_Active: /request-otp (SET NX)
    OTP_Active --> Pending_Approval: /verify-otp (GETDEL)
    OTP_Active --> Idle: TTL Expired (10m)
    Pending_Approval --> Active_Grant: /create-grant (Approved)
    Pending_Approval --> Idle: Decline grant request 
    Active_Grant --> Idle: Manual revocation or TTL expired